{name: 'Abraham'} -> 'Not a string'
``` def make_acronym(phrase):
	\nUse Call-Based format
[code] def make_acronym(phrase):
    if not isinstance(phrase, str):
        return 'Not a string'
    if not phrase.replace(' ', '').isalpha():
            return 'Not letters'
    if phrase == '':
        return phrase
    return phrase[0].upper().replace(' ', '')
